    <string name="pengguna_wajib_memberikan_data_yang_benar_akurat_dan_terkini_saat_melakukan_pendaftaran_n_pengguna_bertanggung_jawab_menjaga_kerahasiaan_akun_dan_kata_sandi_mereka">
        - Users must provide true, accurate, and up-to-date information during registration.\n - Users are responsible for keeping their account and password confidential.
    </string>
    <string name="aplikasi_ini_hanya_dapat_digunakan_sesuai_dengan_ketentuan_yang_berlaku_dan_tidak_untuk_tujuan_yang_melanggar_hukum_n_setiap_bentuk_penyalahgunaan_aplikasi_akan_mengakibatkan_penghentian_akses_secara_sepihak">
        - This application can only be used according to the applicable terms and not for unlawful purposes.\n - Any misuse of the application will result in unilateral access termination.
    </string>
    <string name="informasi_polis_dan_layanan">Policy Information and Services</string>
    <string name="informasi_yang_ditampilkan_pada_aplikasi_mengacu_pada_data_polis_asuransi_yang_tercatat_di_sistem_perusahaan_n_perusahaan_berhak_memperbarui_atau_mengubah_informasi_layanan_tanpa_pemberitahuan_sebelumnya">
        - The information displayed in the app refers to the insurance policy data recorded in the company system.\n - The company reserves the right to update or change service information without prior notice.
    </string>
    <string name="klaim_dan_pembayaran">Claims and Payments</string>
    <string name="semua_klaim_dan_pembayaran_premi_dilakukan_sesuai_prosedur_yang_tercantum_dalam_polis_asuransi_masing_masing_n_perusahaan_berhak_menolak_klaim_yang_tidak_memenuhi_persyaratan">
        - All claims and premium payments are carried out according to the procedures stated in each insurance policy.\n - The company has the right to reject claims that do not meet the requirements.
    </string>
    <string name="privasi_dan_keamanan_data">Privacy and Data Security</string>
    <string name="perusahaan_berkomitmen_untuk_melindungi_data_pribadi_pengguna_sesuai_dengan_peraturan_yang_berlaku_n_data_pengguna_tidak_akan_dibagikan_kepada_pihak_ketiga_tanpa_persetujuan_pengguna_kecuali_diwajibkan_oleh_hukum">
        - The company is committed to protecting users personal data in accordance with applicable regulations.\n - User data will not be shared with third parties without user consent, except as required by law.
    </string>
    <string name="frequently_asked_questions">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</string>
    <string name="q1">
        How to search for partner hospitals through the app?
    </string>
    <string name="a1">
        The list of partner hospitals can be found in the main menu
    </string>
    <string name="q2">
        How can I see my policy details in the app?
    </string>
    <string name="a2">
        Users can open the Insurance Information page by entering their password first
    </string>
    <string name="q3">
        What should I do if I forgot my password?
    </string>
    <string name="a3">
        Users can change their password in two ways: \n- Click the Forgot Password button on the login page \n- Click Change Password on the profile page
    </string>
    <string name="q4">
        What is meant by insurance limit?
    </string>
    <string name="a4">
        Insurance limit is the maximum cost covered by the insurance company according to the policy provisions
    </string>
    <string name="q5">
        Can I apply for policy data changes through the app?
    </string>
    <string name="a5">
        Policy data changes in the app must be submitted directly to the insurance provider. Users can contact the insurance provider via the phone number listed in the app
    </string>
    <string name="q6">
        How do I file a claim through the app?
    </string>
    <string name="a6">
        Users can submit claims by contacting the insurance provider through the contact details available in the app
    </string>
    <string name="q7">
        How to pay insurance premiums through the app?
    </string>
    <string name="a7">
        Users can pay insurance premiums by clicking the Pay Premium button on the main page or by clicking the premium payment reminder notification
    </string>
